Appendix A bowl-order rank formula `1+regularMod(drop-1,720)` കൃത്യമായ M-sized drop-ിൽ പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 probe. ഈ fixture-ൽ drop=M=2^127-1; expected one-based rank 127 ആണ്.

Hamlet, Mയും drop-ും സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, doubling count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, 720 divisor സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, flow-വും assignment-വും സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: M നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: one, count 127.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Juliet]

Scene II: doubling loop.
Hamlet:
 Are you better than nothing?
Juliet:
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Hamlet:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Juliet:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene III: M=2 power 127 minus 1.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.

Act II: 720 divisor-ും rank-ും.

Scene I: 720 നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 You are a big big big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big hero.

Scene II: one-based rank.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
